tools_raw.description:
Unsave/unbookmark a previously saved job.

Args:
    job_id: The Naukri job ID to unsave (required)

Returns:
    {status: "success", action: "unsaved", job_id}
    or {status: "error", message, error_code: "NOT_FOUND"}

Pull saved jobs from Naukri server and merge with local tracking.

Returns:
    {status, total_remote, new_added, already_local, total_local}

Get unread notification count.

Returns:
    {status, count}

Mark all unread notifications as read (paginated, up to MAX_MARK_ALL_ITERATIONS batches).

Returns:
    {status, marked_count, already_read, total_processed, errors?}

List companies you've blocked from contacting you.

Returns:
    {status, count, companies: [{id, name}]}

Check email and mobile verification status from your profile.

Returns:
    {status, is_email_verified, is_mobile_verified, email, mobile}

Get Naukri 360 subscription status, expiry, and feature flags.

Returns:
    {status, is_subscribed, expiry_date, features: {...}}

Get the AmbitionBox slug for a company. Supports batch via comma-separated group_ids.

Args:
    group_id: Single group ID or comma-separated IDs (e.g. "123" or "123,456,789")

Returns:
    Single: {status, group_id, company_slug, company_name}
    Batch:  {status, slugs: {group_id: slug_or_null, ...}, count}

Get previous mock interview history, scores, and feedback.

Returns:
    {status, total, count, page, has_more, interview_count, interviews: [{...}]}

Get resume metadata — filename, upload date, download URL, cv_id.

Returns:
    {status, resume_headline, file_name, upload_date, file_size, download_url, cv_id}

Get profile photo metadata — URL, format, upload date.

Returns:
    {status, has_photo, photo_url, format, status_label, upload_date, download_api}

List available resume builder templates (free and pro variants with preview images).

Returns:
    {status, count, free_count, pro_count, templates: [{id, name, type, preview_url}]}

Get resume builder service status — AI rewrite attempts left, subscription tier, features.

Returns:
    {status, attempts_left, is_paid, show_genai_features, show_rewrite, experiment_variant}

Get full agent configuration (searches, blocklist, mode, limits).

Returns:
    {status, config: {...full config...}}
